 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Ten Shadows — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>Once you reach the 3rd level, you have gained access to your other spirits, and you must face them in ritual combat alone to gain access to them. As an action, you can summon an untamed Shikigami within 30 ft of you without spending cursed energy. Any creature within 50 feet is considered participating in the ritual. An untamed shikigami will be berserk (attack the nearest creature), but if you have defeated the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EMuqLweHWYLnx1On473iLcpcU0xnmZ3qBlKh91p7-hU/edit?tab=t.0\">shikigami</a> alone (not including your shikigami) and reduce it to 0 hit points, you can now summon the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EMuqLweHWYLnx1On473iLcpcU0xnmZ3qBlKh91p7-hU/edit?tab=t.0\">shikigami</a> normally as an action for up to 1 hour and can dismiss them as a bonus action. You can summon a number of <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1EMuqLweHWYLnx1On473iLcpcU0xnmZ3qBlKh91p7-hU/edit?tab=t.0\">shikigami</a> at a time equal to half your level rounded up (Divine Dogs and Rabbits each count as one entity).</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Cursed Energy</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Shikigami</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">1 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Gama</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">2 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Nue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">4 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Great Serpent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">6 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Rabbit Escape</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">7 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Mourn Tiger</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">8 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Max Elephant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">9 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Round Deer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">10 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Piercing Ox</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">20 Cursed Energy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">Divine General Mahoraga</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>If reduced to 0 hit points during a trial with multiple participants, you do not make death saving throws until all participants are unconscious.  </p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
